==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 6.67~16 seconds<sup>200f~480f</sup>.
*6 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 40~80 seconds<sup>1,200f~2,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.67~6 seconds<sup>20f~180f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dark Emperor Santa]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Shy Boy]]s spawn, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
**1 [[The Face]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Send out [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cats]] and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] after about 5-7 Those Guys appear. Doge Darks will come out so start spawning [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cats]] as well. After defeating the first Doge Dark, you may want to start spamming [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cats]] on top of your Wall Cats because Gory Darks will spawn soon. Keep on meatshielding and sending out your attackers, Sexy Legs Cat and Dragon Cat.

You might want to spawn [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] out as your cats start hitting the castle. A few more Gory Darks and Doge Darks along with The Face will spawn with the boss, Dark Emperor Santa. Keep meatshielding to stall the boss, and use your long range attackers to stack up damage from a safe distance. Use any [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cats]] you may have to finish the level faster. Make sure to fire the Cat Cannon to interrupt Dark Emperor Santa's attack, although you must time it well. Once The Face and Dark Emperor Santa die, you are free to claim your victory!

